1. Monitor frame rates (target 60fps)
2. Track memory usage and optimize
3. Measure load times
4. Profile and optimize critical paths
5. Log performance metrics
6. Take immediate action on performance issues 
7. Return to `development-workflow.mdc` and continue to next phase - be sure to update the stats in development loop per that document's requirements.